# ML artefacts — NOTE: must be the data path specifically; a bare "models/"
# also swallowed backend/app/models/ (the SQLAlchemy source code!) and broke CI.
backend/data/models/*
# …except the two small JSON maps the test suite reads. Without them CI
# silently skipped the four club-identity tests and the imputation one —
# green, but not actually checking the thing that broke twice this month.
!backend/data/models/club_team_ids.json
!backend/data/models/impute_medians.json
*.pkl
*.joblib
*.model

